  "definition": "Timing of Remittance",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-08-18",
  "historyNote": "#8495, eff 11-30-05; ss by #10484, eff 12-5-13; ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (formerly Rev 2502.03) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)",
